 const b=p('Barrowfield');if(b&&num(b.units)>0)cards.push(card('idea','PUSH A WINNER',safe('Give Barrowfield the hero slot.'),'Build a '+safe('Barrowfield BEIGE')+' try-on rail and one full-look reel. Show the shirt on a person, then the fit at the collar and sleeve. Give it the first Shopify collection slot as a separate test.',safe(b.units)+' retail units in the supplied '+esc(T.date||'')+' read. '+safe('BEIGE L')+' accounts for '+safe((b.skus||[]).filter(x=>x.size==='L').reduce((n,x)=>n+(num(x.units)||0),0))+' of them. Dressjet\'s public page identifies Barrowfield as a tailored-fit shirt. This is a named merchandising lead, not a claim that it already wins online.','Start with the sizes physically available. Photograph one complete outfit, reuse the reel on the product page, and ask the Jaipur team to record try-ons and sales separately. Keep the test price unchanged.','LOW · one rail + one shoot',time('Retail product sales',retailAt)+' · '+checked,link(source.bar,'Barrowfield product page')+route('best','Open retail evidence'),'Barrowfield try-on-to-purchase rate in store; product-page add-to-cart rate online.'));
