 const che=op('The summer stienfield CHESTER TM');if(che)cards.push(card('idea','WEDDING / CHANNELS','Give every wedding function its own outfit.','On Shopify, test "Welcome dinner" and "Next-day brunch" edits: '+safe('CHESTER TM')+' as the dinner candidate, '+safe('Aurum Lock / SandFord polos')+' for brunch. On Myntra, lead with the strongest complete outfit image allowed by its listing rules.','The supplied online read shows '+safe(che.units)+' CHESTER TM units across '+safe((che.skus||[]).map(x=>x.size).filter(Boolean).join('/'))+'. Myntra\'s 28 Apr 2025 campaign explicitly split wedding shopping by function. This supports an occasion-led presentation, not a claim that these products suit every ceremony.','Choose actual stocked variants, shoot one dinner and one brunch outfit, and reuse the verified fit/size details across Myntra, Ajio and Nykaa Fashion. Do not spread paid budget equally: these readings do not show product-level channel conversion or margin.','MEDIUM · two outfit stories',time('Online product sales',onlineAt)+' · '+checked,link(source.wedding,'Myntra ·2025 wedding campaign')+link(source.aurum,'Aurum Lock product identity')+route('orders','Review online orders'),'outfit-edit clicks and product conversion; compare channel returns before increasing spend.'));
